hous   white stellate region which displays several 0 1cm diameter cysts  An 0 3cm diameter blood filled cavity is present at the center of this focus  Lateral to the nipple within the deep parenchyma is a 4 x 3 x 1cm band of densely sclerotic parenchyma  The axillary tissue is dissected extensively and no axillary lymph nodes are identified  SECTION CODE  A  nipple B  scar superomedial to nipple C  scar medial to nipple D  scar lateral to nipple E  inked margin deep to superior medial scar F I  scirrhous tissue deep to superior medial scar J K  tissue deep to medial scar L  margin deep to lateral sclerotic breast M N  sclerotic tissue lateral to nipple  corresponding to deep margin in L  O  representative unremarkable breast P T  axillary tissue representative  Resident  Andrea Flieder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  Donald S Kaufman  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
