cted and entirely frozen as FX 1  now in G  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  more superior sentinel node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm lymph node with a small amount of attached fatty tissue  The lymph node is bisected and entirely frozen as FX 2  now in H  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  separate lateral mass   is a REMOVED_DATE 0 x 2 0cm aggregate of three pieces of breast tissue  which are unoriented  Within the largest piece  there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm firm mass and a separate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm firm mass  both of which abut inked margins  One half of each nodule is frozen as fx 3  The remainder of the parenchyma is fatty with focally fibrous and rubbery areas  Frozen section  3 is now in I  The remainder of both nodules is submitted in J  Representative sections of the fibrous and rubbery areas are submitted in K L  Received   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional medial margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm fragment of tan yellow fatty tissue  inked  sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes I and J  Received   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  more inferior sentinel node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm lymph node surrounded by fatty tissue  bisected and submitted entirely in cassette K  Received   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional axillary contents   are multiple aggregates of fatty nodular tissue REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  dissected for nodes which are submitted in cassette M  Labeled with the patient s name  unit number and  final shave margin   are three fragments of fibrofatty tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm in aggregate  inked  sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes N  O  P and Q  Gross Description by  