bile and measures 1 5cm in greatest dimension  In the mid outer to predominately lower outer breast  there is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm ill defined  gray white  hard tumor mass with associated hemorrhage  The tumor mass abuts the anterior margin laterally and is 3 5cm from the posterior margin  The tumor is not clearly delineated from surrounding firm fibrosis  which spans 10 5cm  superior inferior  x 10 x 8cm and involves the lower outer and upper outer breast  The firm fibrosis abuts the anterior and posterior margins  Irregular strands of firm fibrosis continue to track through the fat into the central and medial breast  In the lower inner quadrant there is an irregular  gray white  hard mass  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and located 0 5cm from the anterior margin  0 2cm from the posterior margin  and 1 0cm from the medial margin  Firm areas of fibrosis also abut the anterior and posterior margins in the medial half of the breast  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Main tumor mass  mid outer to lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  lower inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma between the largest mass and the lower inner quadrant mass showing firm fibrosis   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma away from lesions  upper breast    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial aspect of main tumor mass  lower outer quadrant  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tumor to anterolateral margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Inferior boundary of 10 5cm area of firm fibrosis   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior aspect from the midportion of the 10 5cm area of firm fibrosis   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior aspect from the midportion of the 10 5cm area of firm fibrosis   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Superior boundary of 10 5cm area of firm fibrosis   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrotic parenchyma from central breast   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nipple  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative firm fibrosis from m