ner  M D  Signed On  12 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 12 16     HORMONE BINDING ASSAY Addendum     THIS ADDENDUM HAS BEEN DELETED FOR THIS REPORT GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the frozen section lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  left breast mass  is a 2 x 2 x 1cm fibrofatty piece of tissue with a needle localization wire  The external surface is inked and sectioning reveals a firm  poorly defined  gray white tumor  measuring 0 8cm in greatest diameter  A small piece of tissue is taken as frozen section  1 and the block is kept frozen  The remainder of the tissue is submitted in cassettes A E  Gross Description by  C  Diana Jordan  MD Resident  David Andrews  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST   LEFT  BIOPSY  INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST MASS   report_end  , Unchecked.
