itted from posterior to anterior as R DD  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast additional contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x0  4 x 0 4cm tan pink rubbery lymph node which is submitted in toto as K  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm irregular tan pink to yellow  lobulated portion of fibroadipose tissue with a black nondesignated suture at one aspect  Multiple tan pink rubbery lymph nodes are grossly appreciated ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 2 5cm in maximum dimension  The lymph nodes are entirely submitted sequentially from the nondesignated black suture to the opposing aspect that follows  L  one whole lymph node  M  one whole lymph node  N O  one bisected lymph node  P  one bisected lymph node  Q  three whole lymph nodes  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  JOSHUA B  KISH  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLARY   DISSECTION PART C  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLARY  ADDITIONAL   EXCISION , Unchecked.
