gin  ADD ON  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number are three specimens  Labeled  additional shaved deep  posterior margin  are two fragments of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm in aggregate  The specimen is inked and submitted entirely in cassettes V through U  Labeled  additional shaved anterior margin  are four fragments of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm in aggregate  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes D and W  Labeled  left axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of unremarkable adipose tissue from which multiple lymph nodes are extracted ranging in size from 0 3cm to 2 5cm  The lymph nodes have been submitted in cassettes X through FF  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  HENRY DONG  MD O R  Diagnosis by  XXRUFFOLO EUGENE F                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Simon Powell  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA  PART C  BREAST  LEFT  ADDITIONAL DEEP MARGIN    EXCISION PART D  BREAST  LEFT  ADDITIONAL ANTERIOR MARGIN    EXCISI   report_end  , Unchecked.
