ozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right axillary sentinel lymph node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm irregular tan yellow nodular fibrofatty portion of soft tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted for frozen as FX 1  now as G  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right axillary non sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm irregular tan pink rubbery lymph node which is bisected  and entirely submitted in cassette H  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast final shaved margin  stitch at new margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm irregular tan yellow to pink lobulated and focally hemorrhagic portion of fibrofatty tissue with a suture along one aspect designating the new margin  The sutured new margin is inked black  the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable tan yellow to pink cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes I P  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  NORMA RODRIGUEZ  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY  SENTINEL   EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  TAI YUAN LIN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  ESTHER OLIVA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL  EXCISION PART B  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  LYMPH NODE RIGHT AXILLA NON SENTINEL  EXCISION PART D  BREAST RIGHT FINAL MARGIN  EXCISION , Unchecked.
