asuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 6 0cm  and comes to within 0 3cm of the deep margin  The area around the biopsy cavity consists of unremarkable breast tissue  The margin of the cavity is submitted in cassette K  6 0cm medial to this cavity is a white  fibrous  stellate  puckered firm area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  This lesion comes to within 1 5cm of the nearest excisional margin  Representative sections of the stellate lesion are submitted in cassettes L through O  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  DUCATAL CARCINOMA OF BREAST  IN SITU AND INVASIVE  O R  Resident  DARRYL E  PALMER TOY  MD PhD O R  Diagnosis by  G  Richard Dickersin  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
